      106.57,
      547.21,
      153.64
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals, (b) the Bodies,Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafterto submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said MediationBoard areas :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      92.59,
      166.57,
      547.26,
      177.64
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than their own for appointment to the Panel",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      109.15,
      178.57,
      258.47,
      189.64
    ],
    "text": "of a particular Mediation Board area :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.99,
      202.57,
      547.23,
      213.64
    ],
    "text": "(i) a Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Local Head of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      214.57,
      547.21,
      237.64
    ],
    "text": "a Department in an office located within the Administrative District in which that particular MediationBoard area is situated ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      116.59,
      250.57,
      547.19,
      261.64
    ],
    "text": "(ii) the Head of a Place or religious worship or of a school situated in that particular Mediation Board area is",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      262.57,
      171.32,
      273.64
    ],
    "text": "situated ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      114.43,
      286.57,
      547.19,
      297.64
    ],
    "text": "(iii) a retired Head of a Department or a retired Head of a School residing in that particular Mediation Board",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      298.57,
      154.99,
      309.64
    ],
    "text": "area ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      113.71,
      322.57,
      263.01,
      333.64
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.87,
      346.57,
      547.25,
      357.64
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submit nominations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      109.15,
      358.57,
      346.04,
      369.64
    ],
    "text": "for appointment to the Panel of any Mediation Board area :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.99,
      382.57,
      547.19,
      393.64
    ],
    "text": "(i) Anybody, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence for at least five years and which is",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      394.57,
      482.63,
      405.64
    ],
    "text": "engaged in carrying out or serving anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      418.57,
      522.48,
      443.8
    ],
    "text": "(a) the promotion of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community ;(b) the promotion of social welfare and the relief from poverty ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      446.65,
      352.07,
      471.64
    ],
    "text": "(c) the promotion of rural community development ;(d) the promotion of culture of sports ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.59,
      474.73,
      547.34,
      485.8
    ],
    "text": "(e) the promotion of projects, programmes and activities intended to provide and supply basic needs",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      486.73,
      347.59,
      497.8
    ],
    "text": "of the peoples such as health, food and shelter.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      92.59,
      510.73,
      547.25,
      521.8
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      109.15,
      522.73,
      300.44,
      533.8
    ],
    "text": "the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      118.99,
      546.73,
      534.41,
      557.8
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretary of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      116.59,
      570.73,
      547.23,
      581.8
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Persons who are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular mediation area and whose names may",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      133.15,
      582.73,
      223.88,
      593.8
    ],
    "text": "be so submitted are \u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.59,
      606.73,
      471.36,
      617.8
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person resident in Mediation Board are engaged in any work in that area ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.87,
      630.73,
      547.15,
      641.8
    ],
    "text": "(b) any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board area, if the Commission",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      642.73,
      341.02,
      653.8
    ],
    "text": "so decides in exceptional circumstances ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      140.59,
      666.73,
      547.21,
      677.8
    ],
