      47.85,
      108.01,
      539.95,
      147.16
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) Individual and Bodies, Organizations and Institutions referred to Para (1) above may not submit nominationsof such persons as are specified in Paras 2(a) and 2(b) above who are not Public Officers, They may, however, nominateProvincial Public Officer. An individual is not entitled to nominate himself or herself.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      163.93,
      539.94,
      189.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Para 2(a) above may submit nominations of Public Officers of who not more thanfive may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      205.93,
      187.29,
      217.0
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.29,
      234.01,
      398.73,
      245.08
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nomination substantially in Form (a) below ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      96.57,
      262.09,
      532.43,
      273.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) Bodies, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      97.29,
      289.93,
      526.46,
      301.0
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      318.01,
      539.92,
      343.0
    ],
